    {
      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals for 7 studies in children: nasopharyngeal aspirate with a microbiological reference standard. Sensitivity ranges from 0.33 to 0.67 where estimable and specificity from 0.50 to 0.99.",
